# .cursorrules — Cursor IDE Context

## Project: TrendPulse

AI-driven market intelligence for gaming studios. Multi-provider LLM routing, RAG, circuit breaker.

## Architecture

- `src/trendpulse/api.py` — FastAPI app
- `src/trendpulse/service.py` — Business logic
- `src/trendpulse/core/llm/gateway.py` — LLM Gateway with circuit breaker
- `src/trendpulse/core/llm/routing.py` — Model routing

## Commands

```bash
make install   # pip install -e ".[dev]"
make test      # pytest tests/
make lint      # ruff check src/
make run       # uvicorn api:app --reload
```

## Key Patterns

- All configs via Pydantic Settings
- Use `from trendpulse.schemas import *`
- Circuit breaker in `core/llm/gateway.py`
- Rate limiter in `rate_limiter.py`
- Read AGENTS.md before code

## Ignore

- `data/`, `logs/`, `*.log`
- `venv/`, `.venv/`
- `.env` files